  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Livelihoods Youth (GLY) Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of this action is to contribute to improved livelihoods of young women and men in Arua and Adjumani districts through creation of green employment options and strengthening youth governance, advocacy and decision-making capacities at local and national levels.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
